    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24068" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δενν-άζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέννος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>abuse, revile,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					1211
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέχνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					925
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ ψόγοισι δεννάσεις ἐμέ</span>”
